  "version": "other",
  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending Code of Criminal Procedure art. 55A.005): A person to whom this subchapter applies is entitled to have all records and files relating to the arrest expunged if: (1)  the person was{+:+} {+(A)+}  tried for and convicted of the offense for which the person was arrested; {+or+} {+(B)+} {+placed on deferred adjudication community +} {+supervision under Subchapter C, Chapter 42A, for the offense for +} {+which the person was arrested;+} and (2)  the offense was committed before September 1, 2021, under Section 46.02(a), Penal Code, as that section existed before that date.",
